  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and ake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620615f629c7c21cbb50e258/step-48e1fb0f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice onion and tomato.\n• Slice haloumi into 2 thin pieces per person.\n• In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, garlic seasoning, a pinch of pepper and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620615f629c7c21cbb50e258/step-289326f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion until softened and starting to brown, 5-6 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Return pan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620615f629c7c21cbb50e258/step-0efa06b2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake burger buns directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Halve buns and spread with mayonnaise. Top with salad leaves, tomato, haloumi and onion.\n• Serve with fries and your favourite dipping sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/620615f629c7c21cbb50e258/step-2f2264d8.jpg"
    }
  ]
